{"content": "<div class=\"noBackground\"><div><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row modulesTitle text-center header-design-position-under-header\"><div class=\"col-xs-12\"><div class=\"page-header-wrap\"><h1>Tour programmes in Poland</h1></div><div class=\"header-separator-container\"><hr class=\"small\"></div></div></div></div></div></div> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-3 col-md-3 col-sm-3\"><img src=\"https://arcadia-tour.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/800_gi-67afb99684910.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive img-rounded-10\" alt=\"Tourism programs in Poland\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:10px auto\"></div><div class=\"col-lg-9 col-md-9 col-sm-9\"> <div class=\"responsive-handler fr-view breakable\"> <div><h2 style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: center;margin-top:20pt;margin-bottom:6pt\"><span style=\"font-size:19pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700\">A tour programme for Poland  </span></h2><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:17pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700\">10 days - 9 nights</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.295;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">Tourism in <a href=\"https://arcadia-tour.com/en/tourism-in-poland/\">Poland</a> is a wonderful opportunity to enjoy a beautiful European flavour that is unique in character and different from anything you have encountered before. A trip to Poland has a pleasure all of its own, whether you are enjoying the Polish countryside or mountain climbing and skiing in winter. Do not miss the delicious dishes of Poland’s distinctive cuisine. You can visit more than one city and discover Poland’s heritage, culture and architecture.</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">The daily programme runs for 8 hours</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">From 10 am to 6 pm</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">Enjoy a tour programme delivered to the highest standard </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\"><span contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"fr-img-caption fr-fic fr-dib fr-draggable\" style=\"width: 800px\" draggable=\"false\"><span class=\"fr-img-wrap\"><img src=\"https://arcadia-tour.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2000_685d2dd258c10.jpg\" style=\"width: 800px; height: 400px\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"Cottages in Zakopane\"><span class=\"fr-inner\" style=\"text-align:center;display:block;margin-top:5px;\" contenteditable=\"true\"><strong>Cottages in Zakopane </strong></span></span></span></span></p><h2 style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:18pt;margin-bottom:6pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700\">Day 1   </span></h2><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700\">Krakow </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">On arrival at Krakow Airport, you will be met by our representative and transferred to the hotel. Our representative will give you an overview of your tour programme and timings, and any information you may need during your visit.</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">Free evening to explore Krakow</span></p><h2 style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:18pt;margin-bottom:6pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700\">Day 2 </span></h2><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700\">Krakow </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">Breakfast at the hotel </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">A day exploring Krakow, including:</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">A visit to Wawel Castle  </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">A tour of Krakow city centre </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">Lunch in Krakow city centre</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\"><span contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"fr-img-caption fr-fic fr-dib fr-draggable\" style=\"width: 800px\" draggable=\"false\"><span class=\"fr-img-wrap\"><img src=\"https://arcadia-tour.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2000_685d2dec4c85c.jpg\" style=\"width: 800px; height: 400px\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"Krakow\"><span class=\"fr-inner\" style=\"text-align:center;display:block;margin-top:5px;\" contenteditable=\"true\"><strong>Krakow</strong></span></span></span></span></p><h2 style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:18pt;margin-bottom:6pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700\">Day 3</span></h2><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700\">Zakopane </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">After breakfast, head to Zakopane, which is about 110 km from Krakow </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">A day exploring Zakopane, including: </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">A trip to Gubałówka Mountain, taking the cable car to the top</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">Zakopane mountain train</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">A tour of the mountain market </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">A tour of Zakopane city centre</span></p><h2 style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:18pt;margin-bottom:6pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700\">Day 4</span></h2><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700\">Zakopane </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">Breakfast at the hotel </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">A trip into the heart of Zakopane’s nature, including: </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">A trip to Lake Czorsztyn and a ride on the summer toboggan run</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">River cruise on the Dunajec River </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\"> Lunch at a restaurant on the river</span></p><h2 style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:18pt;margin-bottom:6pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700\">Day 5</span></h2><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700\"> Zdiar in Slovakia</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">Breakfast at the hotel </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">A trip to the municipality of Zdiar in Slovakia, including:</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">A walk on the suspension bridge </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">Lunch at a panoramic restaurant in the Tatra Mountains</span></p><h2 style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:18pt;margin-bottom:6pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700\">Day 6 </span></h2><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700\">Zakopane </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">Breakfast at the hotel </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">Free day </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">   </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700\">Day 7</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700\">Zakopane </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">Breakfast at the hotel </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">A trip <span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">to</span> a cheese factory in Zakopane </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">Cable car ride <span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">to</span> the summit of Kasprowy Wierch</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">or </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">A trip <span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">to</span> the Kościeliska Valley</span></p><h2 style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:18pt;margin-bottom:6pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700\">Day 8</span><span style=\"font-size:16pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000\"> </span></h2><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700\">Zakopane - Krakow </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">Breakfast at the hotel </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">Road trip from Zakopane <span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">to</span> Krakow through the Polish countryside</span></p><h2 style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:18pt;margin-bottom:6pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700\">Day 9</span></h2><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700\">Krakow </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">Breakfast at the hotel </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">Visit outlet shops and malls in Krakow</span></p><h2 style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:18pt;margin-bottom:6pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700\">Day 10</span></h2><p style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: right;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">After breakfast, check out of the hotel and transfer to the airport with our representative </span></p><h2 style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:18pt;margin-bottom:6pt\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700\">Price includes </span></h2><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px\"><li style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\"><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">Airport pick-up and drop-off </span></p></li><li style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\"><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">Accommodation in a 4- or 5-star hotel of your choice in Krakow and in distinctive cottages in Zakopane, according to your budget.</span></p></li><li style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\"><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">Accommodation per person with a varied buffet breakfast </span></p></li><li style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\"><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">Free internet SIM card </span></p></li><li style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\"><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">Price includes taxes </span></p></li><li style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\"><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">Transfers for individuals in a VIP car with a driver, and in luxury coaches for groups </span></p></li><li style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\"><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\">Arabic-speaking guide  </span></p></li></ul><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><a href=\"https://arcadia-tour.com/en/poland/\"><strong>Poland tourism guide</strong></a><br><br><br><br><br></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#000000\"><span > </span></span><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#252525;font-weight:700\"> Arcadia Tourism Company</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.5;text-align: right;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 15pt 0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#252525;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">For enquiries and contact</span><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#252525;font-weight:700\"> :</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.5;text-align: right;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 15pt 0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#252525;font-weight:700\">WhatsApp: +7 706 400 7561</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.5;text-align: right;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 15pt 0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#252525;font-weight:700\">Email:</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.5;text-align: right;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 15pt 0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#4a90e2\"> info@</span><a href=\"https://arcadia-tour.com/en/home/\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#4a90e2\">arcadia-tour.com</span></a><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#252525\"> </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.5;text-align: right;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 15pt 0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#4a90e2\">toursarcadia4@gmail.com</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.5;text-align: right;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 15pt 0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#252525;font-weight:700\">Website: </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.5;text-align: right;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 15pt 0pt\"><a href=\"https://arcadia-tour.com/en/home/\"><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;color:#4a90e2\">https://arcadia-tour.com/</span></a></p></div> </div></div></div> </div>\n\n", "_elementor_data": ""}